== REAL-DATA-02: independent tile overlap verification ==

criteria fixed before classification: CONFIRMED if the pessimistic (p5) shared fraction of the worse-covered tile is >= 0.50;
INSUFFICIENT if the optimistic (p95) fraction is < 0.20; otherwise UNKNOWN.

